 "applies_to": "Liebert PSI5 line-interactive UPS units.",
 "summary": "The Liebert PSI5 / Vertiv Edge UPS reports to a BMS through a Liebert IntelliSlot card (BACnet IP or BACnet MS/TP). Analog Values carry input, bypass, output and battery measurements, Binary Values carry UPS events, and Multi-state Values carry system status, output source and settings. Objects are created when the card discovers the UPS.",
 "bacnet_transport": [
  "BACnet IP",
  "BACnet MS/TP"
 ],
